This product is a DeepSeek Harness (DSH) port of TokenEconomizer:
  Project: https://github.com/microsoft/TokenEconomizer
  Commit:  e428fc91b0f8ffecb5a596d56b14fe2f1485a5f9 (2026-10-30)
  Paper:   https://arxiv.org/abs/2610.22732
  License: Apache License 2.0

The micro-skills, tool-pruning, failure-loop-intervention, usage-ledger and
pricing designs in this project are derived from TokenEconomizer. The DSH
adaptation layer (Cordis plugin entry, event hooks, slash commands, config,
state storage, packaging) is new work. See docs/UPSTREAM.md for the per-module
derivation map and the list of upstream components that are not ported.

